#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kbounce; is a single player arcade game with the elements of puzzle."
msgstr "&kbounce; je arkadna igra za jednog igrača sa elementima slagalice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is played on a field, surrounded by walls, with two or more balls that "
"move about in the field bouncing off of walls. The player can build new "
"walls, decreasing the size of the active field."
msgstr ""
"Igra se na terenu, okruženom zidovima, sa dva ili više kuglica koje se kreću "
"okolo u polju odbijajući se od zidove. Igrač može graditi nove zidove, "
"smanjujući veličinu aktivnog polja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The goal of the game is to fill at least 75&percnt; of the field and advance "
"to the next level."
msgstr ""
"Cilj igre je popuniti najmanje 75&percnt; polja i preći na naredni nivo."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "How To Play"
msgstr "Kako Igrati"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The player is presented a rectangular tiled field surrounded by walls. Two "
"or more balls move about in the field and bounce off of the walls. The "
"object of the game is to limit the size of room for the balls."
msgstr ""
"Igraču je predstavljeno pravougaono popločano polje okruženo zidovima. Dvije "
"ili više kuglica se kreću na terenu i odbijaju od zidove. Cilj igre je da se "
"ograniči veličina prostora za kuglice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The size of the active area of the field is decreased by making new walls "
"that enclose areas without balls in them. To complete a level, the player "
"must decrease the size of the active field by at least 75&percnt; within the "
"time allowed."
msgstr ""
"Veličina aktivnog područja polja je smanjena sa stvaranjem novih zidova koji "
"zatvaraju područja bez lopte u njima. Da bi završili nivo, igrač mora "
"smanjiti veličinu aktivnog polja za najmanje 75 &percnt; u dozvoljenom roku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"New walls are built by clicking the &LMB; in an active area of the field, at "
"which point two walls will begin to grow in opposite directions from the "
"square the mouse was clicked in. Only one wall in each direction may be "
"growing on the screen at any given time."
msgstr ""
"Novi zidovi su izgrađeni klikom na &LMB; u aktivnom području na terenu, na "
"mjestu na kojem će dva zida početi rasti u suprotnim smjerovima od mjesta "
"gdje je kliknuto mišem. Samo jedan zid u svakom pravcu može se raste na "
"zaslonu u svakom trenutku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the mouse is on the field, the cursor is shown as a pair of arrows "
"pointing in opposite directions, either horizontally or vertically. The "
"arrows point in the direction the walls will grow when the &LMB; is clicked. "
"This direction can be changed by clicking the &RMB;."
msgstr ""
"Kad je miš na terenu, kursor je prikazan kao par strelica u suprotnim "
"pravcima, bilo horizontalno ili vertikalno. Strelice pokazuju u pravcu gdje "
"će zidovi rasti kada je &LMB; kliknut. Ovaj pravac se može promijeniti "
"klikom na &RMB;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A new wall has a <quote>head</quote> which moves away from the point where "
"the mouse was clicked. A wall is not permanent until this <quote>head</"
"quote> runs into another wall. If a ball collides with any part of the wall "
"except the head, before the head has run into another wall, the new wall "
"will disappear completely and one life will be lost. If a ball collides with "
"the head in the direction of the wall's growth, the wall will stop growing "
"there, and become permanent, with no loss of life. If a ball collides with "
"the head from any other side, the ball will bounce off and the wall will "
"continue to grow normally."
msgstr ""
"Novi zid ima <quote> glava </quote> koja se udaljava od tačke gdje je "
"kliknuto mišem. Zid nije trajan dok ovo <quote> glava </quote> udara u drugi "
"zid. Ako je lopta u koliziji sa bilo kojim dijelom zida, osim glave, prije "
"nego što glava udarila u drugi zid, novi zid će nestati u potpunosti i jedan "
"život će biti izgubljen. Ako je lopta u koliziji sa glavom u smjeru rasta "
"zida, zid će prestati rasti tamo, i postati trajan, bez gubitka života. Ako "
"je lopta u koliziji sa glavom sa bilo koje druge strane,  lopta će se odbiti "
"i zid će nastaviti normalno rasti."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila Igre, Strategija i Savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules"
msgstr "Pravila Igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game starts with level 1 in which two balls move around in the field. "
"The player has two lives and 90 seconds to successfully complete the level."
msgstr ""
"Igra počinje sa nivoom 1 u kojem dvije lopte se kreću na terenu. Igrač ima "
"dva života i 90 sekundi za uspješan završetak nivoa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In n-th level there are n + 1 balls. The player is given n + 1 lives. They "
"have 30 * ( n + 2 ) seconds to complete it."
msgstr ""
"Na n-tom nivou ima n+1 kuglica. Igračima je dato n+1 života. Imaju  30*(n+2) "
"sekundi da ga riješe."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When a ball collides with a growing wall the player looses one life. An "
"exception is the collision with wall's <quote>head</quote> when no life is "
"lost."
msgstr ""
"Kada lopta udara u rastući zid igrač gubi jedan život. Izuzetak je kolizija "
"sa zidovom <quote> glava </quote> kada nema gubitka života."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The goal of each level is to cover at least 75&percnt; of the field with "
"wall."
msgstr "Cilj svakog nivoa je pokriti bar 75&percnt; polja zidovima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The loss of all lives and exceeding the time allowed result in the end of "
"the game."
msgstr ""
"Gubitak svih života i prekoračenje dozvoljenog vremena rezultuje kraju igre."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a player completes a level he receives 15 points for each life left, and "
"a bonus depending on the number of balls and the number of tiles filled "
"above 75&percnt;. They also advance to the next level."
msgstr ""
"Ako igrač završi nivo on dobija 15 bodova za svaki život koji mu je ostao, a "
"bonus ovisi o broju lopti i broju pločica ispunjenih iznad 75&percnt;. Oni "
"su također unaprijeđeni na sljedeći nivo."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Strategije i Savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many players find the game becomes quite difficult by only the third or "
"fourth level, given the number of balls on the field at once."
msgstr ""
"Mnogi igrači smatraju da igra postaje prilično teška već na trećem ili "
"četvrtom nivou, s obzirom na broj lopti na terenu odjednom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The trick playing &kbounce; successfully is to build <quote>corridors</"
"quote>. To build a corridor, start a pair of walls growing close to another "
"wall, and time it so that one of the walls will be hit by a ball and one of "
"the walls will not, and thus become permanent."
msgstr ""
"Trik za igru &kbounce; je uspješna izgradnja <quote> koridora </quote>. Za "
"izgradnju koridora, pustite par zidova da rastu blizu drugog zida, i "
"tempirajte ih tako da jedan od zidova bude pogođen loptom i jedan od zidova "
"neće, i tako postane trajan."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Building a corridor</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Izgradnja koridora</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Building a corridor</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Izgradnja koridora</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will leave a narrow corridor only a few squares high on the field, "
"surrounded on three sides by walls. Wait for the balls to bounce into the "
"open end of the corridor, and close the corridor behind the ball with a new "
"wall. Although you will most likely lose a life for each corridor created, "
"you can trap several balls in a single corridor."
msgstr ""
"To će ostaviti uski koridor visok samo na nekoliko kvadrata na terenu, "
"okružen zidom sa tri strane. Sačekajte kuglice da odskoče u otvoreni kraj "
"koridora i zatvorite koridor iza kuglice sa novim zidom. Iako ćete "
"najvjerojatnije izgubiti život za svaki koridor koji ste stvorili, možete "
"nekoliko lopti uhvatiti u jednom hodniku."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Capturing balls in a corridor</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Hvatanje lopte u koridoru</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Capturing balls in a corridor</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Hvatanje lopte u koridoru</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A final tip &mdash; take your time! There is plenty of time, as shown in the "
"<guilabel>Time</guilabel> display at the bottom of the screen. Rushing will "
"just get you in trouble!"
msgstr ""
"Konačni savjet &mdash;  iskoristite svoje vrijeme! Ima dosta vremena, kao "
"što je prikazano na <guilabel> Vrijeme </guilabel> ekranu na dnu ekrana.  "
"Žurba će vas samo uvaliti u probleme !"

