#: index.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select a game difficulty. On higher difficulty levels the walls are build "
"slower while balls move faster. That makes it harder to fence an area in the "
"board."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite težinu igre. Na težim nivoima zidovi se grade sporije dok se "
"loptice kreću brže. Tim je teže ograditi područje na tabli."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
