"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings "
"Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Pored toga &kbounce; ima zajednički &kde; <guimenu> Postavke </guimenu> i "
"<guimenu> Pomoć </guimenu> stavke izbornika, za više informacija pročitajte "
"sekcije o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Meni "
"postavki</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\"> "
"Meni Pomoći </ulink> od  kde; osnovama."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Često postavljena pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim da promijenim izgled igre. Mogu li ?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To change &kbounce; visual theme you can use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kbounce;...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> option on the menubar."
msgstr ""
"Da. Za promjenu &kbounce; vizualne teme možete koristiti <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu> Postavke </guimenu> <guimenuitem> Konfiguracija &kbounce; ... </"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> na traci izbornika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:438
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr "Napravio sam grešku. Mogu li poništiti?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:439
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kbounce; does not have an <quote>Undo</quote> feature."
msgstr "&kbounce; nema <quote>Poništi</quote> svojstvo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:442
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play this game?"
msgstr "Da li mogu koristiti tastaturu da igram ovu igru ?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:443
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kbounce; cannot be played using keyboard."
msgstr "Ne. &kbounce; se ne može igrati koristeći tastaturu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:446
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"Moram da napustim igru, ali još nisam završio. Da li mogu da snimim napredak?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kbounce; does not have a <quote>Save</quote> feature at the moment."
msgstr "&kbounce; nema <quote>Spasi</quote> svojstvo u ovom momentu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:452
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kbounce; configuration dialog allows you to select visual themes for "
"&kbounce;."
msgstr ""
"&kbounce; konfiguracijski dijalog vam omogućava da odaberete vizualne teme "
"za &kbounce;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select a new theme simply choose the theme from the selection list. Each "
"item in the list shows a small preview left to the theme name. A selection "
"is immediately applied."
msgstr ""
"Da biste izabrali novu temu jednostavno izaberite temu sa liste za izbor. "
"Svaka stavka na listi pokazuje mali pregled izabrane teme lijevo od imena "
"teme. Izbor se odmah primjenjuje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:459
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you are satisfied with the theme you have selected you can click the "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> button, located at the bottom part of this dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste zadovoljni s temom koju ste izabrali možete kliknuti na <guibutton> "
"OK </guibutton>, koji se nalazi na donjem dijelu ovog dijaloga."

